# (build 138d) The approach to Mother Brain goes through white. LevelScreen
# (ps2.asm:11338) tests event_flags for $E00 -- what the approach (loc_70D6)
# sets -- and leaves through loc_634E (into white: red up first, then
# green, then blue) instead of PaletteFadeFrom, and comes back through
# loc_62CC (every entry white, then down to the loaded palette: blue
# first, then green, then red) instead of PaletteFadeTo. Until 138d the
# port changed level through black both ways. The start is
# mother_brain_no's. Fails on 138c.

start level $64 33 37
wait idle
walk up 4                    # returns as the fourth step begins
wait idle                    # at rest on cell 33
wait ticks 2                 # the floor is looked at: the approach
wait ticks 3
expect pixel 4 4 $008        # black into white, red first (before 138d $000)
wait ticks 17
expect pixel 4 4 $EEE        # the 21st frame: white
wait ticks 1
expect pixel 160 112 $CEE    # the reload, from white: blue down first (before 138d $222)
wait ticks 3
expect pixel 160 112 $CAC    # there: blue, green, then red
wait idle
expect script $1813          # the confrontation follows as before
